00:14:41,823 --> 00:14:49,303
ホロライブインドネシア3期生、holoh3roです！
hololive Indonesia 3rd Generation, holoh3ro!

146
00:14:52,823 --> 00:14:59,263
Waah, enggak nyangka juga deh, konser 5th Anniversary hololive ID ini akhirnya ada juga!
Wow, I really didn't expect this 5th Anniversary hololive ID concert to finally happen!

147
00:14:59,823 --> 00:15:02,713
Dari lagu pertama aja udah keren banget, guys! Kerasa nggak?
From the very first song, it's already so cool, guys! Can you feel it?

148
00:15:04,292 --> 00:15:05,572
いやいや、そうじゃない？いや、そうじゃん？
No, right? Right?

149
00:15:05,672 --> 00:15:06,272
やばいっすね
That's crazy, man.

