00:21:35,922 --> 00:21:45,322
よしよし！さてみんな そしてholoh3roも 「holoh3ro！」って言ったら「HU-HA!」で返してね！簡単でしょう？
All right! Now everyone, and holoh3ro too! If I say "holoh3ro!", you reply with "HU-HA!", okay? Easy, right?

200
00:21:45,922 --> 00:21:50,322
さあさあさあさあ！ 準備はいい？holoh3ro！
Come on, come on! Are you ready, holoh3ro?

